          "sections": [
            {
              "key": "condition",
              "html": "<p><img alt=\"\" data-asset-id=\"96e3c6e4-b09e-49f1-a1df-ef6e6e3fab93\" data-asset-key=\"image_1\" data-transformation-target-id=\"asset:image_1\" src=\"/assets/96e3c6e4-b09e-49f1-a1df-ef6e6e3fab93\"/>На ри­сун­ке изоб­ражён гра­фик функ­ции <span data-inline-latex=\"f(x)=k\\sqrt{x}\"></span> . Най­ди­те <span data-inline-latex=\"f(6{,}76)\"></span> .</p>",
              "title": "Условие",
              "asset_keys": [
                "image_1"
              ],
              "section_id": "condition:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:condition:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "answer",
              "html": "<p><span data-effect=\"spaced\">6,5</span></p>",
              "title": "Ответ",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "answer:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>По гра­фи­ку <i>f</i>(4)  =  5, тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\cdot \\sqrt{4}=5\\iff 2k=5\\iff k=2{,}5\"></span>. Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(6{,}76)=2{,}5\\cdot \\sqrt{6{,}76}=2{,}5\\cdot 2{,}6=6{,}5\"></span>.</p></center>",
              "title": "Решение",
              "asset_keys": [],
              "section_id": "solution:1",
              "transformation_target_id": "section:solution:1"
            }
          ],
