              "transformation_target_id": "section:answer:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>По гра­фи­ку, <i>f</i>(4)  =  −3, тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\cdot \\sqrt{4}=-3\\iff 2k=-3\\iff k=-1{,}5\"></span>. Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(2{,}56)=-1{,}5\\cdot \\sqrt{2{,}56}=-1{,}5\\cdot 1{,}6=-2{,}4\"></span>.</p></center>",
