              "transformation_target_id": "section:source:1"
            },
            {
              "key": "solution",
              "html": "<p>По гра­фи­ку, <i>f</i>(8)  =  4, тогда <span data-inline-latex=\"k\\cdot \\sqrt{8}=4\\iff k=\\sqrt{2}\"></span> . Таким об­ра­зом, </p><center><p><span data-inline-latex=\"f(32)=\\sqrt{2}\\cdot \\sqrt{32}=\\sqrt{64}=8\"></span>.</p></center>",
